    "Buy Now": "Køb nu",
    "View Live Demo": "Se Live Demo",
    "One Solution For All Your Property Management Needs": "Én løsning til alle dine ejendomsadministrationsbehov",
    "Simplify property management tasks seamlessly with our comprehensive module, covering everything from tenant management  to maintenance requests and financial reporting.": "Forenkle ejendomsadministrationsopgaver problemfrit med vores omfattende modul, der dækker alt fra lejeradministration til vedligeholdelsesanmodninger og finansiel rapportering.",
    "The Smartest Way To Manage Your Property Management": "Den smarteste måde at administrere din ejendomsadministration på",
    "Transform property management into a streamlined process with our robust module, designed to handle property details, tenant relationships, lease agreements, and maintenance requests with ease.": "Transform ejendomsadministration til en strømlinet proces med vores robuste modul, designet til at håndtere ejendomsdetaljer, lejerforhold, lejeaftaler og vedligeholdelsesanmodninger med lethed.",
    "Manage Key Tenant Matters Easily": "Håndter nøglelejersager nemt",
    "Create a profile for every tenant and track their key information, including property unit and document. Update and change their information in just a few clicks.": "Opret en profil for hver lejer og spor deres nøgleoplysninger, herunder ejendomsenhed og dokument. ",
    "Lease Renewal": "Fornyelse af lejemål",
    "At the end of the lease term, the parties may choose to renew the lease, negotiate new terms, or terminate the lease according to the specified process.": "Ved udløbet af lejeperioden kan parterne vælge at forny lejemålet, forhandle nye vilkår eller opsige lejemålet efter den angivne proces.",
    "Manage All Your Property Management Tasks Quickly And Easily From One Place": "Administrer alle dine ejendomsadministrationsopgaver hurtigt og nemt fra ét sted",
    "Control and keep track of your invoices with ease. Enhance property oversight and maximize efficiency with our user-friendly Property Management Module, offering a centralized platform for lease management, rent collection, and property maintenance.": "Styr og hold styr på dine fakturaer med lethed. ",
    "Manage Your Property Management From One Place": "Administrer din ejendomsadministration fra ét sted",
    "Oprate a Fast and Easy Property Management process": "Opret en hurtig og nem ejendomsadministrationsproces",
    "Make your property lease process fast and convenient for your tenants. select date of when you want to rent property and select the unit your tenants want to stay and after click on Book Now.": "Gør din ejendomsleasingproces hurtig og bekvem for dine lejere. ",
    "Manage Your Payments Easily": "Administrer dine betalinger nemt",
    "Get paid for work done, fast. Integrate several payment options for diverse tenants and make the payment process stress-free. Easily safeguard your tenants’ payment by using Stripe, PayPal, Flutterwave, and more.": "Få betalt for udført arbejde, hurtigt. ",
    "Get Instant Notifications": "Få øjeblikkelige meddelelser",
    "Integrate the Twilio app and never miss an important notification again. Get notified when property unit booking are completed and get notifications about new property unit booking sent to your mobile phone via text.": "Integrer Twilio-appen og gå aldrig glip af en vigtig notifikation igen. ",
    "Modify Vital Property Management Info With Ease": "Rediger vitale oplysninger om ejendomsadministration med lethed",
    "Modify and update your generated property management property units with ease. Add new property, unit and his details without stress. Property Management allows you to create and maintain the data of each tenant. You get access to all essential information through a well-maintained format.": "Rediger og opdater dine genererede ejendomsadministrationsenheder med lethed. ",
    "Essential Information At Your Fingertips": "Vigtig information lige ved hånden",
    "Optimize your property portfolio effortlessly using our Property Management Module, featuring intuitive tools for lease administration, tenant communication, and real-time performance analytics.": "Optimer din ejendomsportefølje uden besvær ved hjælp af vores Ejendomsstyringsmodul, der byder på intuitive værktøjer til lejeadministration, lejerkommunikation og realtidsanalyse af ydeevne.",
    "Why choose dedicated modules": "Hvorfor vælge dedikerede moduler",
    "for Your Business?": "til din virksomhed?",
